# Client-side (Vite) variables. Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored via `*.local`).
# Anything prefixed VITE_ is baked into the public bundle — never put secrets here.
# Server-side secrets (SESSION_SECRET, STREAM_SIGNING_KEY_*) live in `.dev.vars` / Pages env.

# Cloudflare Stream customer code: the `customer-<code>` part of your Stream
# embed subdomain (Stream dashboard → any video → Embed). Used by the video
# player to build `https://customer-<code>.cloudflarestream.com/<token>/iframe`.
# When empty the player falls back to the generic `iframe.videodelivery.net`
# host, which only works for unsigned/public videos.
VITE_STREAM_CUSTOMER_CODE=
